arly and we talk about this  kind of thing all the time and you talk  about in the book and this is a fabulous  phrase as a woman what does it mean to  know the power of your voice you know  it's not use it all the time but it's  knowing when to use it and when you use  it make it mean something and I think a  lot of times it's not how much you say  it's what you say and so I've always  tried to tell everyone to use the power  of their voice you can move mountains  with your voice if you use it for good  sometimes when people find their voice  they they have so much anger that they  can't stop talking or saying the wrong  thing at the wrong times just they're  spewing that's different than finding  your voice that's exactly right  look I saw I heard a lot of spewing at  the United Nations so I can tell you  that that that happens but our words  matter we see it on the 24-hour news  cycle thing anything to say and so they  have to say something and it doesn't  come out well exactly right it's not  it's not well thought out and  and you know when you've got an avatar  instead of someone signing their name to  their hate on online digital courage  which is actually cowardice it goes  there so ambassador thank you for taking  time to come by we're honored to have  you in our home  oh this has been a lot of fun thank you  so much ambassador nikki Haley the book  is with all due respect defending  America with grit and grace and having  better it's been a little time with her  I'm sure that's exactly what you'll find  between the covers this is the Dave  Ramsey show  [Music]
 

